---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import CTABanner from '../../components/sections/CTABanner.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Code-generierte Pipelines — Agentic Engineering | Capygator"
  description="Von der Anforderung zum fertigen Fabric Notebook — AI-gestützte Pipeline-Entwicklung mit Code-Review durch erfahrene Augen."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb animate-fade-up delay-1" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/agentic-engineering">Agentic Engineering</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb-sep" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span>Pipeline-Generierung</span>
      </nav>
      <p class="page-label animate-fade-up delay-2">Use Case</p>
      <h1 class="page-title animate-fade-up delay-3">
        Von der Anforderung zum<br />
        <span class="text-accent">fertigen Notebook.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="page-sub animate-fade-up delay-4">
        Pipeline-Entwicklung ist repetitiv: Daten lesen, transformieren, schreiben, testen.
        AI-Agents beschleunigen den Prozess — mit Code-Review durch erfahrene Augen, nicht blind generiert.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROBLEM -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">Warum Pipeline-Entwicklung so lange dauert</p>
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">80%</span>
          <span class="stat-desc">jeder Pipeline ist Boilerplate</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">5&times;</span>
          <span class="stat-desc">schneller mit AI-Unterst&uuml;tzung</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">0</span>
          <span class="stat-desc">Kompromisse bei Qualit&auml;t</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="problem-text">
        Schema-Definition, Fehlerbehandlung, Logging, Datentyp-Konvertierung &mdash; notwendig aber nicht wertsch&ouml;pfend. Ihre Data Engineers sollten &uuml;ber Gesch&auml;ftslogik nachdenken.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="problem-quote">
        <p>&bdquo;AI schreibt den Code, der Mensch reviewt &mdash; das Beste aus beiden Welten.&ldquo;</p>
        <cite>&mdash; Mein Workflow</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- DELIVERABLES -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Was Sie bekommen</h2>
      <div class="deliverables-grid">
        <div class="deliverable-card">
          <span class="deliverable-icon">01</span>
          <h3>Pipeline-Templates</h3>
          <p>AI-generierte Notebook-Templates für Ihre häufigsten Ingestion-Patterns. Parametrisiert, dokumentiert, sofort einsetzbar.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="deliverable-card">
          <span class="deliverable-icon">02</span>
          <h3>Schema-zu-Code Agent</h3>
          <p>Quell-Schema rein, fertiges Fabric Notebook raus. Inkl. Datentyp-Mapping, Fehlerbehandlung und Delta-Table-Schema.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="deliverable-card">
          <span class="deliverable-icon">03</span>
          <h3>Test-Generierung</h3>
          <p>Automatisch generierte Tests für jede Pipeline: Zeilenzählung, Schema-Validierung, Referenzielle Integrität. Kein manuelles Test-Schreiben mehr.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="deliverable-card">
          <span class="deliverable-icon">04</span>
          <h3>Code Review & Standards</h3>
          <p>Jeder generierte Code wird gegen Ihre Coding Standards geprüft. AI schreibt, Mensch reviewed — das Beste aus beiden Welten.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROCESS -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ablauf</h2>
      <div class="process-steps">
        <div class="process-step">
          <span class="step-num">01</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Standards & Templates</h3>
            <p>Ihre Coding Standards dokumentieren, Template-Bibliothek aufbauen, AI-Prompts für Ihren Stack kalibrieren. Typisch: 2 Tage.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <span class="step-num">02</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Pilot-Pipelines</h3>
            <p>3-5 echte Pipelines AI-gestützt generieren, reviewen und in Produktion bringen. Learnings in Templates zurückfließen lassen. Typisch: 3-5 Tage.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <span class="step-num">03</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Team-Enablement</h3>
            <p>Ihrem Team zeigen wie sie die Agents selbst nutzen. Prompts, Workflows, Best Practices — damit es ohne mich weitergeht. Typisch: 1-2 Tage.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOR WHOM -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">F&uuml;r wen</p>
      <div class="personas-list">
        <div class="persona-card">
          <span class="persona-badge">C</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Gesch&auml;ftsf&uuml;hrung</h3>
            <p>Wollen ihre Fabric-Entwicklung beschleunigen &mdash; ohne zus&auml;tzliche K&ouml;pfe einzustellen.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="persona-card">
          <span class="persona-badge">IT</span>
          <div>
            <h3>IT-Leitung</h3>
            <p>Sehen dass ihre Engineers zu viel Zeit mit Boilerplate verbringen &mdash; und wollen den Output pro Kopf steigern.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="persona-card">
          <span class="persona-badge">BI</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Data Engineers</h3>
            <p>Wollen sich auf Gesch&auml;ftslogik konzentrieren statt zum hundertsten Mal try-catch-Bl&ouml;cke zu schreiben.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABanner
    headline="Pipelines schneller bauen?"
    subline="Lassen Sie uns an einem konkreten Beispiel zeigen wie AI-gestützte Pipeline-Entwicklung in Ihrem Stack aussieht."
  />
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .breadcrumb a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .breadcrumb-sep {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb span:last-child {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .page-hero {
    padding: 10rem 0 4rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .page-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .page-sub {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    max-width: 560px;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .content-section {
    padding: 3rem 0;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .content-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .content-section p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .content-section p + p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .stat-card {
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .stat-number {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .stat-desc {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .problem-text {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .problem-quote {
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .problem-quote p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .problem-quote cite {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .personas-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .persona-card {
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .persona-badge {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-accent-dim);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .persona-card h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .persona-card p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .deliverables-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .deliverable-card {
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 2rem;
    transition: border-color 0.3s;
  }

  .deliverable-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-border-hover);
  }

  .deliverable-icon {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .deliverable-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .deliverable-card p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .process-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .process-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 2rem;
    transition: border-color 0.3s;
  }

  .process-step:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-border-hover);
  }

  .step-num {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .process-step h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .process-step p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .deliverables-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .process-step { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; }
    .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .persona-card { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.75rem; }
  }
</style>
